An original illustration made for OpenDB to show the look of [[dorfic|DORFic]]: bright daylight, glossy orange and red graphics, a futuristic control panel with chevrons and a gauge, a factory skyline and a piece of sterile lab equipment. It is not taken from any real product or game.
